<main class="main"><div class="editor-intro"><div><span class="editor-kicker">Rédaction / Le journal public</span><h1>Des analyses qui se lisent.</h1><p>Préparez, relisez et programmez les publications du site. Un brouillon reste privé.</p></div><div class="editor-actions"><a class="editor-button light" href="/journal.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ouvrir le journal ↗</a><a class="editor-button" href="/panel-x9k3m/journal.php?new=1#edition">Nouvel article +</a></div></div>
